289	    /**
290	     * Whether this owner has been soft-deleted. A newly created owner is not deleted;
291	     * {@code DELETE /api/owners/{id}} sets this true while retaining the row, and the
292	     * create-owner duplicate/identity checks ignore owners flagged deleted.
